Package: scAvengeR
Type: Package
Title: Collection of utilities related to single-cell transcriptomics analyses
Version: 1.0.1
Author: David Barras
Maintainer: The package maintainer <david.barras@chuv.ch>
Description: This package contains toolkit for single-cell transcriptomics analyses spanning cell type proportion interrogation, differential gene expression, gene pathway analyses and ligand-receptor cell-cell interactions.
